## 3. Target Architecture and Ownership

```text
WorldState (objective truth and persistence)
  → existing event hook / event perspective
  → Tier Router
  → Perception and knowledge gate
  → Appraisal
  → Emotion / Stress / Trauma
  → Needs / Goals / Memory / Relationship / Values
  → NPCCognitiveDeductionEngine (cognitive inference)
  → Candidate generation, feasibility, scoring, decision
  → causal state update, versions, cache invalidation, trace
  → LLM expression projection
  → dialogue / narration
```

| Layer | Owns | Must not own |
|---|---|---|
| `WorldState` | objective facts, persistent save container, world version | NPC knowledge/belief |
| Psychology Layer | current psychology, appraisal, state transitions, memory selection | replacement cognitive inference |
| `NPCCognitiveDeductionEngine` | hypothesis validation, intent prediction, BDI reasoning, motive chain, micro-leakage | independent mutable psychology data |
| `MemoryManager` / RAG | semantic candidate retrieval | authoritative memory or final decision |
| Decision Pipeline | deterministic decision orchestration | direct LLM authority |
| LLM | language, subtext, optional candidate/interpretation proposal | permanent writes or unverified facts |
| Decision Cache | reusable decision results | source-of-truth state |

