## 12. Tier 3 Debug Trace

Every Tier 3 decision emits a structured `DecisionResult.decision_trace` containing at minimum:

- NPC ID/name, tick, tier, cache hit;
- situation and perceived facts;
- active and dominant emotions, stress, trauma matches;
- relevant memories with significance/source/confidence;
- active goals and need pressure;
- relevant relationship snapshot;
- value conflict and its resolution;
- candidates, scores, infeasibility blocks, and modifiers;
- selected action and runner-up actions;
- selection reason and deterministic decision distribution when used;
- causal imperfection source and magnitude;
- state versions and cache invalidation/commit effects.

The trace must explain why a decision happened without becoming a second mutable state store.

