## Final Principle

An NPC is not alive because an LLM sounds convincing. It is alive because a deterministic, persistent, explainable system connects:

```text
personality + temperament + values
→ motivation + need + goal
→ memory + trauma
→ emotion + stress
→ relationship + perception + beliefs
→ appraisal + cognitive inference
→ candidate scoring + decision
→ causal state update
→ language realization
```

The Psychology Layer creates current psychological state, the existing Cognitive Engine reasons over it, and the LLM expresses the validated result.
